      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:t4lr35'
    male|a|grave|There is no alternative inside it, no comparison, no decision — it measures a burden, and it can rank nothing at all.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 12600
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:7520ip'
    male|a||Yet it is the figure that reaches ministries and newspapers, quoted as if a large burden by itself proved a treatment worth funding.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 8280
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:1rpqfq0'
    male|a||Four questions, four answers — and only this one can rank a rare drug against a common one. The method you pick decides what you are even allowed to conclude.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 10440
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:1aq6m0l'
    male|a||Cost-effectiveness, cost-utility, cost-benefit — the arithmetic is identical in all three; only the unit in the denominator changes.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 9800
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:5h9x2m'
    'male|a||Row one: what is compared. Cost-effectiveness sets two options against a single clinical outcome — infections avoided, cases detected, motor milestones reached.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 11880
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:ykgmx6'
    'male|a||Cost-utility takes the same two options but scores health as a whole: years of life weighted by the utility of living them.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 8240
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:15xpwxo'
    male|a||Cost-benefit compares any two uses of the same money — a drug against a road, if you like.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 5920
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:uvkcgr'
    'male|a||Each buys that reach with a measurement: something you can simply count, utilities that build into QALYs, or a price in kroner for every single consequence.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 10480
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:8hetnp'
    'male|a||So each supports a different decision: the best buy inside one disease, any health gain against any other, or whether the thing is worth doing at all.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 10000
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:8nhbil'
    male|a||Take nusinersen. In the CEA column the answer is kroner per motor milestone gained — clinically precise, and useless the moment you leave spinal muscular atrophy.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 11880
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:nzsc38'
    male|a||In the CUA column it collapses to one number — illustratively, something like seven and a half million kroner per QALY.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 7720
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:zkbfrh'
    'male|a||And now the contrast case can stand beside it: a hip replacement buys a QALY for roughly sixty thousand kroner.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 8320
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:i4nhxa'
    male|a|grave|Only this column lets those two numbers sit on the same page — over a hundred times more health per krone, bought by the boring operation nobody writes about.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 14600
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:1g4dkoy'
    'male|a||That comparability is CUA''s real strength — and its blind spot: it is deaf to anything that is not health, to dignity, to waiting time, to the school the same krone could have built.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 13800
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:e16a97'
    male|a||Cost-benefit hears all of that, and pays for it by having to put a money value on the health gain itself — which is exactly where its legitimacy gets thin, and where the next lecture starts.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 12360
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:aamxu'
    'male|a||One line each: CEA finds the best buy inside one problem, CUA puts every health gain in one unit, CBA puts health up against everything else.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 12120
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:1rkiyti'
    male|a|grave|Each step widens what you can compare — and raises what you must be willing to value.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 8120
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:1aywo3c'
    'male|a||Our new formulation lands here: twenty thousand kroner cheaper per patient, and — by assumption — exactly no difference in health.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 8920
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:8fg8r'
    'male|a||Sitting precisely on the vertical axis is a very strong claim: with ΔE zero there is no ratio to compute and nothing to weigh, so you simply buy the cheaper one.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 11520
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:sw8rs8'
    male|a||But that zero came from a trial, and its confidence interval ran from a loss of 0.15 QALYs to a gain of 0.19 — every point along this stretch fits the data equally well.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 13520
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:dz5c4d'
    male|a||A p-value of 0.62 says we failed to detect a difference; it does not say we established there is none — the study was simply too small to tell a seventh of a life-year from zero.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 12440
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:o4vafj'
    male|a||Bring in the threshold, 275 000 kroner per quality-adjusted life year, and that stretch stops being abstract.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 8400
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:v4nhr2'
    'male|a||At the lower limit the point sits above the threshold line: we would be surrendering health worth more than the money we saved.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 7840
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:x0pph5'
    'male|a||Net monetary benefit makes the same comparison in kroner: the health difference valued at the threshold, minus the extra cost.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 9040
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:13z4bx7'
    male|a||If the effects truly are identical, the new formulation is worth twenty thousand kroner per patient — and cost-minimisation's answer is the right one.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 9440
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:rl4syq'
    male|a||At the bottom of the interval, the health given up is worth forty-one thousand, so the saving no longer covers it and net benefit turns negative.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 9840
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:1l2db7t'
    male|a||At the top it is cheaper and better — seventy-two thousand kroner of net benefit, a clear yes.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 7080
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:1tq1fuw'
    male|a|grave|One trial, and it supports a confident yes and a confident no; cost-minimisation reports the middle number and calls the matter settled.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 13840
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:12h1rar'
    male|a||It is not always wrong — when equivalence is built into the design, a biosimilar with a formal equivalence trial, or the same infusion given at home instead of in hospital, comparing resource use alone is honest and quick.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 14200
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:112ipim'
    male|a||Applied to a non-significant result, though, it asserts an equivalence nobody ever tested — which is why Briggs and O'Brien asked, in a 2001 paper, whether cost-minimisation analysis was dead.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 12680
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:z8378y'
    'male|a||So run the full analysis and show the uncertainty: a zero you assumed is not a zero you measured.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 7240
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:4bk8nr'
    'male|a||Then the production lost by patients and by parents who cut their hours, and the unpaid care given at home: a hundred and fifty million, and two hundred and fifty.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 10720
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:4k10l8'
    male|a||Add them up and you have the headline — eight hundred million kroner a year; my figures are illustrative, but the shape of this study is exactly real.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 10160
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:va77j'
    'male|a||And here is the question this figure cannot answer: compared with what?':
      mp3: 
      ms: 5080
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:1b0yrsc'
    male|a|grave|There is no second world here — no alternative Norway, doing something else — so nothing on this canvas is a difference, and without a difference there is no ΔC, no ΔE, and nothing to divide.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 18760
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:1fxwl1t'
    male|a||Set the burden aside and look at the shape every economic evaluation actually has.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 5680
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:13oxtew'
    'male|a||One world: a child with spinal muscular atrophy on current care, with cost C-zero and health E-zero.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 9040
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:1ospi53'
    'male|a||A second world: the same child on nusinersen, with cost C-one and health E-one.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 6880
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:cox68u'
    male|a||Subtract on the cost side, and the extra spending appears — roughly twenty million kroner more over that child's lifetime.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 7920
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:qf1vdf'
    male|a||Subtract on the health side, and say four extra quality-adjusted life years appear.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 6560
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:mua1yh'
    male|a||Divide one by the other and you get an ICER, around five million kroner per QALY — a number Beslutningsforum can argue about, because it is a comparison.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 10640
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:1uu980a'
    male|a||So why does that eight-hundred-million figure keep turning up in arguments about whether to buy the drug?:
      mp3: 
      ms: 5760
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:1x583ew'
    male|a||Because a big number persuades, and burden studies are usually commissioned by exactly those who want attention for the disease.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 8800
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:1bu93hw'
    'male|a||They do one job genuinely well: they show where money and carers'' hours already go, which helps plan services and reveals a condition nobody has been counting.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 10920
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:s4ya2j'
    male|a||But the totals inflate easily — value a parent's lost wages here, then the same hours again as unpaid care, and you have counted them twice.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 11040
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:zt6qnm'
    'male|a||And a large burden is not an opportunity: a disease can cost a fortune and still have nothing effective available to buy.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 9080
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:79915x'
    male|a|grave|Cost-of-illness measures the size of a problem; only a comparison of two worlds can tell you what to do about it.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 10360
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:jl5zx5'
    'male|a||First branch: the objective is fixed and single — find latent tuberculosis among new arrivals — and every option you weigh produces that one thing and nothing else.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 12200
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:azcgz7'
    'male|a||Then the honest denominator is the natural unit: kr 12 000 per case detected by one strategy against kr 30 000 by another, with no utility weights in sight.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 12120
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:1mja419'
    'male|a||But the number comes with a fence around it: cost per infection avoided cannot be laid beside cost per hip replaced, so it ranks options only inside its own programme.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 11240
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:1i1nlc9'
    'male|a||Second branch: the options do different kinds of good and reach into the same budget — so they need a common currency, and that currency is the QALY.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 10280
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:xjlks4'
    male|a||Nusinersen came in at millions of kroner per QALY; a hip replacement buys one for a small fraction of that — only cost per QALY puts them on the same page for Beslutningsforum.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 11720
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:vsurt3'
    male|a||The price of that reach is compression — everything a treatment does squeezed into one utility number — which is exactly why the QALY's fairness stays contested.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 10840
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:1aujiru'
    'male|a||Third branch: when the benefit leaves health altogether — time saved, a cleaner river — only cost-benefit analysis can hold it, because it prices the benefit in kroner too.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 11600
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:tjk00x'
    'male|a||And the fourth branch is not really a branch: cost-of-illness compares nothing with nothing.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 7320
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:1mr3ctv'
    male|a||It ranks problems by size, which is why a big burden number travels so well in a press release — but it can never show that spending here buys more health than spending there.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 11320
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:1tlzdqn'
    'male|a||Cost-minimisation fails the same way one level up: it crowns the cheaper option by assuming DeltaE is zero rather than demonstrating it.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 8920
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:1ulct9p'
    'male|a||So the choice is never about which method is most sophisticated — it is about how wide the comparison must be: one programme, or the whole budget.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 10840
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:rf9ixs'
    male|a|grave|What must compete with what chooses the method, before a single cost is collected.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 6760
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:g8wu19'
    'male|a||Four questions, four answers: natural units when the goal is fixed, QALYs when everything competes for the same krone, kroner when the benefit leaves health — and cost-of-illness, which answers none of them, because it never names an alternative.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 17640
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:2y9mtu'
    male|a||One drug, four different questions — and the practical problem is which of those answers a committee can actually act on.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 8120
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical'
    male|a||Beside CEA, CUA and CBA sits a fourth label on the list — the one that claims to need no effect measure at all.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 9240
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical'
    'male|a||Cost-minimisation hides an assumption; a cost-of-illness study counts something else entirely: what spinal muscular atrophy costs Norway in a year, starting with hospital care and the drugs themselves — four hundred million kroner.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 16240
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical'
    male|a||A cost-of-illness study names a burden without ever comparing two options — and the method you should have used was settled long before the costing began — at this square.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 11720
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical'
